WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.000
THE PEOPLE WHO DWELL IN THE SEA

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.700
"The People Who Dwell in the Sea".

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.200
The League Militaire ships are still in pursuit.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:46.300
They think they can bring us down with only two ships?

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:48.930
Authorize the Gedlavs to sortie, sir.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.800
We're about to enter the atmosphere.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.600
That gives us an opening.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.700
If we damage the Reineforce Junior just a bit,

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.900
it'll never withstand the shock of atmospheric entry.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:01:59.960
I see.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.200
Staff Officer Pippiniden, would you advise we do it?

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.260
Thank you, sir!

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.100
Katejina team, moving out!

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.800
Goz Barl, Lieutenant Lupe Cineau, all set?

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.230
Sure thing. Go to it.

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.900
Today, we follow team leader Katejina's command.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.400
Got that, Goz Barl?

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:20.300
Yeah, although I'm nervous having the Earth right in front of us.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.230
They've launched an attack on us!

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.500
Launching to intercept!

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:41.000
Do it! We're scrambling, too! Shrike Team!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.330
All units, watch out for Earth's gravity!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.260
Sending just three units after us? Something's up!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.530
Wouldn't three be a piece of cake?

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.760
We should assume they have some kind of strategy.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.560
Maybe you should stay on the White Ark if you're scared.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.960
Trash talking the enemy just proves how scared you are!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.100
Damn it, Tomáš! I'm just stating the facts!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.530
Quit breaking formation, Odelo! Tomáš!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.060
Don't yell at us, Üso!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.300
Two pilots for you to babysit. Must be tough, huh?

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.500
I just don't want my friends to get killed!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.100
We'll head straight in and attack them head on!

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.200
Target is the enemy carrier!

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:37.600
The tire suits again! I hope that's not Miss Katejina!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.230
I won't let you past!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.300
Trying to stop me?

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.100
They're after the Reineforce?!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.860
A single shot beam rifle against those tires!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.200
They don't work?!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:01.430
Odelo! Tomáš! Fight using me as a shield!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.060
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:02.930
Y... Yes, ma'am!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.060
What?!

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.760
Are you having us dive straight to Earth?

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.860
Is that a good idea? In the middle of a battle?

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.130
No, it's not.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.660
Atmospheric entry by itself is dangerous enough.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.500
Don't assume you can follow the Adrastea down to Earth!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.300
We're about to enter the atmosphere!

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:51.000
All hands, brace for impact!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.230
Ness, the radio's going to black out when we do!

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.830
Running damage check!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.960
Firing signal flare to recall Marbet and the others!

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.800
There's no way we can come back now!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.300
I want to see Zanscare achieve their objective!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.330
To change the world the Oldtypes have made!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:21.400
Why would you join those who use the guillotine?!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.300
What?!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.330
Why, you...!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.930
Odelo! Tomáš! You saved me!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.460
If you let a comrade die, you get killed even faster!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.160
We need to get ready for atmospheric entry!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.360
Where are the enemy ships?

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.760
Üso, atmospheric entry in just a mobile suit is too dangerous!

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.960
Go on without me!

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.030
Damaging the enemy even a little...

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.500
...will make their entry that much harder!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.860
Damage to aft section! Temperature, rising!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:14.200
Reinforce it with a birdlime shield! Maintain descent!

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:19.630
I'm not finished with you!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.130
What? She's coming?!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.500
Why, you!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.830
Üso, as I thought!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.060
Miss Katejina, how could you accept Zanscarism?!

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:31.030
Every time you appear, you've gotten stronger!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.800
It's made you ugly!

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:35.360
I'm... ugly?

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.900
My armor's starting to heat up!

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.700
Václav, I think we should...

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.830
...get inside the Reineforce Junior's shield.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.600
Right.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:59.430
If Üso still isn't back, yet... Gundam, protect Üso!

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.730
Miss Katejina, please, get out of here!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.600
You want to end up melting?!

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.530
If I melt, it's all over!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.830
Gundam, please, hang in there!

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.800
Is Katejina's unit burning up?

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.130
Welcome back to Earth.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.360
And Üso?

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.830
He's fine. He got into the Reineforce Junior's shadow.

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.560
He's already headed back here, to the White Ark.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:14.560
Did the Motorad Fleet really land around here?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.360
This fog proves it, right? They're hiding in it.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.230
There's something floating ahead of us.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.630
Careful, Odelo!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.130
I feel like something fell around here.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:34.030
I forgot! Mobile suits can't fly on Earth!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.030
We need to set our balancers to auto on the ground.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.800
Auto?

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.300
It's my first time piloting on Earth. What do you expect?

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.530
It's the wreckage of a ship.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:55.400
It might be camouflage.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:59.700
Do you think that Motorad ship would fail to make an emergency landing?

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.230
You're right.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:06.260
And I can't believe Miss Katejina would die hating me like that.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.860
Shahkti, come out with us.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.200
I'll be fine.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.160
See the dolphins?

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:41.560
We'll moor at that island's wharf.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.360
Roger.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:44.430
Contact Underhook.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:45.160
Aye, sir!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.030
Whew. Earth air for the first time in forever,

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.530
and support for the League Militaire.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.400
It's huge!

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.800
Do you smell that?

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.860
He peed himself!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.330
Sorry. Suzy, a little help?

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.300
Okay! There you go.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.200
Just hang in there, Karl.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.060
Is his poop green?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.530
It's the because of the sea water.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.830
Right...

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:38.930
Welcome.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.760
Ah, welcome to Underhook.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.960
The mayor asked me to show you around.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.530
I'm Tomáš Masaryk, pilot for the League Militaire!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:50.430
Ah.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.400
We managed to destroy a BESPA warship!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.600
Don't say so much.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.860
We have kids with us. Could you show us where to get some sweets?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:10:59.360
Sure.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.100
Score! Score!

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:02.830
Shahkti!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.960
Look at all the fish!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.460
Miss Katejina?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.560
Shahkti!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.730
You can't wander off like that!

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.960
I think I just saw Miss Katejina.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.600
Where? Where is she?

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.200
They took her into that tunnel.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.700
Üso?

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.730
Üso!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.500
Please relax.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:05.030
You fight to protect Queen Maria.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.830
We here believe in Maria Pure Armonia.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.130
You mean you believe in Queen Maria of Zanscare's desire...

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:16.300
...to build a world based around maternal ideals?

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:20.400
We must envelop the world with love and protect it.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:24.060
Mariaism is the one true path to that end!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:25.600
These people...

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:28.530
Open up! Please, open up!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.630
The boy's followed me all the way here?!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.360
Üso, stop! We don't know where we are!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.800
They took her in there!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:40.100
No one's allowed in there! Not even us!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.600
Please, let me go!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.430
Kid!

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.700
Üso! Are you all right?

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.160
I'm fine.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:57.630
Now that you know about this place, you must convert to Mariaism!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.700
Convert to Mariaism?

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.160
Üso, look.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.500
My belief is that we must change...

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:09.160
...this patriarchal world into a matriarchal one,

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.360
so that we may bring peace to a world of continuous war.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.030
What do you want of us during our sermon time?

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:18.830
Didn't you bring a Zanscare pilot in here?

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:22.660
Zanscare? Not that I know of.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.500
You're hiding her, aren't you? Miss Katejina!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.460
I know you're in here! Miss Katejina!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:32.700
That girl is the true daughter of the queen!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:37.830
A child raised by Maria's strength as a lone woman!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:42.300
We must protect her, and tell her of Queen Maria's hard battle!

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.900
Miss Katejina, what are you talking about?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.900
Please, don't struggle. We don't want any violence.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.560
Shahkti, run for it!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.630
Üso!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.860
Üso! What's wrong?! Open up!

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:56.730
Shahkti!

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:57.660
This way.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.700
No! Please, let me go!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:03.760
Stop it! Miss Katejina, do you really hate us so much?!

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:04.860
I do.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.660
Even though you're just a child, you trouble me.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.030
When next we meet on the battlefield,

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.830
I'll finish you for sure!

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.560
Miss Katejina...

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:16.760
What happened?!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.200
They've taken Shahkti! Get to the back door!

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:20.230
What?!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.500
Shahkti!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.960
I'll tell Marbet and the others! We'll get them to seal off the whole city!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:30.560
Üso!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.730
It's my fault for obsessing over Miss Katejina!

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.360
The underwater tests completed perfectly.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.100
We will now proceed to the underwater city of Underhook,

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.360
where the League Militaire ships have retreated.

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:56.160
Attack with the Doggorla so we can test its undersea capabilities!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.600
Live fire test or whatever, I'll do what it takes!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.100
We have to take care of the little girl, now, don't we?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.860
Do not attack Underhook.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:07.730
Roger!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:15.760
A possible mobile armor is closing with us?

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.400
Send up a missile barrier!

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.260
Assemble the pilots!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:19.900
Aye, sir!

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:28.800
Either notice me and come out, or Underhook will be hit, too!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.530
It's a mobile armor!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.860
Leave port! The Motorad Fleet wasn't destroyed!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.260
Keep firing missiles!

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.230
We'll launch when that thing backs off!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.230
There's nowhere to run!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.360
Wait!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.030
Shahkti!

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.100
Üso!

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.930
How can it move so fast underwater?!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.500
And where are Üso and the others?!

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:42.860
Odelo, let's go!

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.100
Where's Üso?!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.600
Dammit, what's keeping him?!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.960
You all made it back?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.300
Move it, Üso!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.400
Shahkti's still in the city!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:01.130
They've probably closed the bulkheads, so no one else will drown!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:04.130
We've gotta stop the Motorad Fleet's attack!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.330
Where's the enemy fleet?

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:07.600
Probably in the ocean.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.600
Can't the Reineforce lift off?

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.730
Reineforce, lifting off!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:26.000
Üso, fighting underwater isn't easy!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.260
It's reckless!

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.660
So, you've finally come out?

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.430
Üso, what should we do?!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:41.060
Lower your beam saber output and try to cut the net!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.900
Gotcha! I'll try that!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:53.030
I've got the mobility advantage in water!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.500
Beams make the sea water explode!

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:06.500
Don't shoot!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.430
Why won't you let us aboard?!

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.100
We can't go up!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:16.300
Only Marians are allowed aboard this sub!

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.360
This is the only vessel left!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.630
If I bring these Marians back with me...

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.230
To hell with Mariaism!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.130
Damn heretics!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.260
Flanders!

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.900
Please hurry. It's for times like these...

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:31.560
...that we must be resolute in our faith.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:33.430
We must hurry.

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:35.730
Please, let the others aboard.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:40.960
Only those who believe in Mariaism can escape this day of catastrophe.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.200
That's...

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:43.460
Let us aboard!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.260
Stay back, or we'll shoot!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.800
Wasn't Underhook built to save Earth from destruction?!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:58.260
We can make contact with the battleship ahead, right?

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.160
Yes, although it's too bad.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.130
Why?

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.760
I'd hoped to trick the League Militaire...

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.430
...and sabotage the Reineforce from inside.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.330
I see.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.960
Are they trying to smash Underhook?!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:20.230
Üso, all we can do is defend! How do we attack?!

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.560
Everything's heavy here in the ocean!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.330
He can use his rifle effectively underwater?!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.300
I'm not losing to that machine's capabilities in water!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:43.860
What?

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.460
What? Karl?!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.960
Shahkti! What's she doing in there?!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.000
We've been caught by a League Militaire mobile suit!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.930
That thing isn't going to attack this vessel.

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.130
Is that Üso?

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.830
Where are they trying to take Shahkti?!

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:10.000
It's caught up with me!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.260
Don't insult me!

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.600
You fell for it, Gundam!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.730
The whole body will crush you!

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:37.900
Gundam!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:43.100
What?!

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:46.030
He stopped its spinning and dodged my attack?!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.400
The Reineforce still hasn't destroyed the Motorad Fleet?

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.900
Katejina? Good to have you back.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.660
Oh, the princess is with you? Well done!

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:14.300
Recover the Doggorla's escape capsule, then fall back!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:24.460
Dammit, how dare they pollute these seas!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:27.230
Drop sonar! Get a track on them!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:45.430
Don't use the believers from Underhook, and stop fighting, at once.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.000
I beg of you.

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:51.060
I'll consider it, but we cannot stop fighting...

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:53.500
...until the Earth has been cleansed.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:54.930
I want you to understand that.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.930
This Shahkti Kareen girl and Cronicle...

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:02.660
Does anyone really enjoy waging war?

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:08.760
If that's how it is, the fighting will continue.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.960
At last, the operation has begun.

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.800
The fleet carrying both Üso's mother and myself...

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.430
...crushes cities and people beneath it!

00:23:41.260 --> 00:23:45.960
In the chaos, Üso trembles at the thought...

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:49.760
...of using a nuclear blast to stop the fleet.

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:53.400
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.430 --> 00:23:53.530
"Operation Giant Roller".

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.800
Next Episode OPERATION GIANT ROLLER

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:58.230
Please watch it!
